# These pages are GENERATED by ../port-from-capture.js from ../legacy-capture/, which is
# itself a byte-faithful capture pinned with its own `-text`.
#
# Without matching that here, git rewrites these to CRLF on checkout while the generator
# writes LF — so `node port-from-capture.js` on a clean tree would report every ported page
# as modified, every time. A generator whose no-op output looks like a change stops being
# trusted, and then stops being run.
*.html -text
